# The agent networks neuro-san serves.
#
# One per transport mode, because the four are different games: air decides on town population
# against airport coverage, road on many short pairs because one saturates, water on which docks
# share a body of water at all, and rail on platform axis, depot junction and rail type. A single
# network with a mode switch would be four strategies averaged into none.
#
# Air first: it is the mode that scores highest and it exercises the shared foundation. Rail
# second, and it is the interesting one, because it is where a route can look finished in every
# report and carry nothing. Road and water are not written yet.
{
    "ns_air_agent.hocon": true
    "ns_rail_agent.hocon": true
}
